{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b70a9176eef8a563e61002bdbc76267e293537715ee05acf5379036a8c6e4cf9","ja":"スーツの人がいっぱいいますね！\n有名歌手さんのプロデューサーさんなんでしょうか？","zh":"穿西装的人好多呀！\n是知名歌手的制作人吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6ae954dbe46cc9fd45e13834f3e859888bd86bda4e1c94757771a2c35bcf9ed3","ja":"あれはプロデューサーじゃなくて、\n警備の人なんじゃないかしら。","zh":"那不是制作人，\n而是保安人员吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fdc6a1106894c154731ca6a4b896b08acdda4b75fe9daa8cd1fec5190e728865","ja":"あんなにたくさん……すっごい厳重な警備だね！\n挨拶させてもらえるのかな……？","zh":"有那么多人……戒备好森严呀！\n能让我们去打个招呼吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3ec73795d44868119a8bfdbdc6f90f434be51690f5b5e14be7a9d3023e667170","ja":"せっかくここまで来たんだし、\n行くしかないっしょ～！！","zh":"既然都大老远来了，\n那肯定得去啦～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1f222d34d9dc5ead39c7661c29cc555b57af1e91cec1ad57b27821660505f9de","ja":"ってことで、しゅっぱ～つ♪","zh":"所以，出发～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ee5b10ee131eb852cc25fd471b0c81dbdc1d3229821659c9f616b8e4d8fbee89","ja":"ええっ、さ、さすがにまずいんじゃ\nない！？　亜美、ストーップ！","zh":"诶诶，这、这未免不太妙吧\n！？　亚美，快停下——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3","ja":"10分後……","zh":"10分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e7e2b0ee40aa0f52b538c148bbdcf7b99d4f1941d38dbaa4c28d93d613b8cf2b","ja":"なんか、警備の人にめーっちゃにらまれちったね。\n亜美たち、挨拶しようとしただけなのに～！","zh":"感觉被保安人员狠狠地瞪了一眼呢。\n我们只是想打个招呼而已嘛～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f5ffe6ac9d4222921d07e9b6635d2e3c7f6a6fd7bc8598825dcd589495e74e5a","ja":"結局、あきらめて引き返したけど……\nでも、会場の裏側を見れて楽しかったな！","zh":"结果虽然放弃折返了……\n但能看到会场的后台，还是很开心呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"db957c836aa27ea9fb5105ac0e38442cf2e57620aede3b514f7162857831d9b2","ja":"あら、そんなことで満足してちゃダメよ。\n伊織ちゃんはまだ諦めてないんだから。","zh":"哎呀，可不能因为这种程度就满足了哦。\n伊织可还没放弃呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"79bf09fc908781d5a7059b743a8846530b3be14229b112a226f350742b80952e","ja":"いい？　私たちで、会場中を最高に盛り上げるの！\nそしたらきっと、向こうから挨拶に来るに違いないわ！","zh":"听好了？我们要让全场彻底嗨起来！\n那样的话，对方肯定会主动过来打招呼的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"c01eb932f9f3d26ac2f0efcc5e0692a464b1265423f6c4618a8faa6c2e1b434b","ja":"わぁ……なんだかかっこいいです♪","zh":"哇……总感觉好帅气呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1283.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"2b165a835b97e7305550b96c17c58965e0b85fd7fca7b96c7f86b4637918d8c0","ja":"自分もそう思うぞ！　それじゃあ……。","zh":"我也这么觉得哦！那么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
